The institutional evolution function:

I_{t+1} = F(I_t, O_t, \Delta AI_t, \Delta Society_t) \tag{6}

where $O_t$ represents observations, $\Delta AI_t$ represents changes in AI capabilities, and $\Delta Society_t$ represents changes in society. VSM specifies $F$ as a recursive, self-referential function maintaining viability through requisite variety.

